            "CQ6": "The buyer's address is provided via :hasAddress from the buyer :Organization.",
            "CQ7": "Items sold are :Item instances referenced by :referencesItem in :ItemLine(s) of the :DetailSection.",
            "CQ8": "Item information is described by :itemDescription, :netPrice (via :Price), and :quantity (via :ItemLine).",
            "CQ9": "Net price is given by :netPrice property on :Price, linked from :ItemLine via :hasPrice.",
